# 9. Important Difference: Result Per Row vs Result Per Group

This is the **most important point** to remember.

### Single Row Function

```text
Row 1 → Function → Result 1
Row 2 → Function → Result 2
Row 3 → Function → Result 3
```

### Multiple Row Function

```text
Row 1 ─┐
Row 2 ─┼→ Function → One Result
Row 3 ─┘
```

